# {{name}} Backend

This is the backend service for {{name}}, built with [OCaml Dream](https://aantron.github.io/dream/).

## Getting Started

The backend server can be built and run using Dune:

```bash
# Build the backend
dune build

# Run the backend server
dune exec backend/bin/main.exe
```

The server will start on `http://127.0.0.1:8080` by default.

## Project Structure

- `bin/` - Contains the main executable
  - `main.ml` - Main server entry point
  - `dune` - Build configuration for the executable
- `dune` - Backend-specific build configuration
- `README.md` - This file

## API Endpoints

- `GET /` - Returns a JSON hello world message